                <p>See <ref target="frus1945Malta#pg_770">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, The Conferences at Malta and
                        Yalta, 1945, p. 770</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d250-f4" n="4" xml:id="d250-f4-content">
                <p>For the text of the telegraphic report referred to, see “The Entry of the Soviet
                    Union Into the War Against Japan: Military
                    Plans, 1941-1945” (Washington, Department of Defense, processed, 1955), <ref
                        target="#pg72">p. 72</ref>; Sherwood, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">
                        Roosevelt and Hopkins</hi>, <ref target="#pg902">p.
                        902</ref>. Cf. <ref target="#d26">document No. 26</ref>.</p>
            </note>
